        "content": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"zh-CN\">\n<head>\n<meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n<title>3.分数加减混合运算 第1课时 分数加减混合运算</title>\n<script>\nwindow.MathJax = {\n  tex: {\n    inlineMath: [['$', '$']],\n    displayMath: [['$$', '$$']]\n  }\n};\n</script>\n<script id=\"MathJax-script\" async src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/mathjax@3/es5/tex-mml-chtml.js\"></script>\n<style>\n  * { box-sizing: border-box; }\n  body {\n    margin: 0;\n    background: #efeae0;\n    font-family: \"Songti SC\", \"SimSun\", \"STSong\", serif;\n    color: #1a1a1a;\n  }\n  .page {\n    width: 540px;\n    min-height: 720px;\n    margin: 0 auto;\n    background: #f6f2e8;\n    position: relative;\n    padding: 6px 26px 40px 34px;\n  }\n  /* 页眉 */\n  .header {\n    position: relative;\n    height: 30px;\n    border-bottom: 2px solid #2b57a5;\n    margin-bottom: 6px;\n  }\n  .header .logo {\n    display: inline-block;\n    font-size: 13px;\n    color: #2b57a5;\n    font-weight: bold;\n    letter-spacing: 1px;\n    padding-left: 26px;\n  }\n  .header .swoosh {\n    position: absolute;\n    left: 0; top: 2px;\n    width: 24px; height: 22px;\n    border-radius: 50% 50% 50% 10%;\n    background: #2b57a5;\n    opacity: .85;\n  }\n  .header .hdr-right {\n    position: absolute;\n    right: 130px;\n    top: 2px;\n    font-size: 13px;\n  }\n  /* 标题 */\n  h1.sec {\n    text-align: center;\n    font-size: 17px;\n    font-weight: bold;\n    margin: 10px 0 2px 0;\n  }\n  h2.lesson {\n    text-align: center;\n    font-size: 16px;\n    font-weight: bold;\n    margin: 4px 0 10px 0;\n    letter-spacing: 1px;\n  }\n  .tanjiu {\n    text-align: center;\n    margin: 6px 0 10px 0;\n    font-size: 17px;\n    color: #2f7fbf;\n    font-weight: bold;\n  }\n  .tanjiu .red {\n    color: #d33a2c;\n    border: 2px solid #d33a2c;\n    border-radius: 50%;\n    padding: 0 6px;\n    margin-left: 6px;\n  }\n  /* 两栏 */\n  .cols {\n    display: flex;\n    gap: 14px;\n  }\n  .col {\n    width: 50%;\n    font-size: 12.5px;\n    line-height: 1.7;\n  }\n  .col-right { position: relative; }\n  /* 表格 */\n  table.gift {\n    border-collapse: collapse;\n    margin: 6px auto 10px auto;\n    font-size: 11px;\n    width: 96%;\n  }\n  table.gift th, table.gift td {\n    border: 1px solid #333;\n    text-align: center;\n    padding: 2px 3px;\n    line-height: 1.25;\n  }\n  table.gift th.rowhead, table.gift td.rowhead {\n    width: 54px;\n    font-weight: normal;\n  }\n  .qnum { font-weight: bold; color: #1b3f8f; }\n  .method { margin: 8px 0 2px 0; }\n  .step { margin-left: 14px; }\n  .note-blue { color: #1b3f8f; }\n  /* 红色手写批注 */\n  .hand {\n    color: #d8342a;\n    font-family: \"Kaiti SC\", \"KaiTi\", \"STKaiti\", cursive;\n    font-weight: bold;\n  }\n  .hand-note {\n    position: absolute;\n    font-size: 15px;\n    line-height: 1.5;\n    transform: rotate(-4deg);\n  }\n  .circle-red {\n    color: #d8342a;\n    border: 2px solid #d8342a;\n    border-radius: 50%;\n    padding: 0 3px;\n  }\n  .oval-red {\n    display: inline-block;\n    border: 2px solid #d8342a;\n    border-radius: 50%;\n    padding: 0 5px;\n    color: #d8342a;\n  }\n  .box-red {\n    display: inline-block;\n    border: 2px solid #d8342a;\n    padding: 0 4px;\n    margin: 2px 0;\n  }\n  .strike { text-decoration: line-through; text-decoration-color:#d8342a; }\n  /* 对话气泡 */\n  .bubble {\n    border: 1.5px solid #2b57a5;\n    border-radius: 10px;\n    background: #eaf3fb;\n    font-size: 10.5px;\n    line-height: 1.45;\n    padding: 4px 6px;\n    color: #1b3f8f;\n  }\n  /* 占位符 */\n  .placeholder {\n    border: 1px dashed #9a9a9a;\n    background: #f0ece1;\n    color: #777;\n    font-size: 9px;\n    text-align: center;\n    display: flex;\n    align-items: center;\n    justify-content: center;\n    font-family: sans-serif;\n  }\n  .fig-row {\n    display: flex;\n    align-items: flex-start;\n    gap: 6px;\n    margin: 6px 0;\n  }\n  /* 页脚 */\n  .footer {\n    position: absolute;\n    left: 30px;\n    bottom: 8px;\n    display: flex;\n    align-items: center;\n    gap: 8px;\n  }\n  .footer .pagenum {\n    border: 1.5px solid #2b57a5;\n    color: #2b57a5;\n    border-radius: 50%;\n    width: 22px; height: 22px;\n    display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center;\n    font-size: 11px;\n    font-family: sans-serif;\n  }\n  .frac { display: inline-block; text-align: center; vertical-align: middle; }\n  .divider-v {\n    position: absolute;\n    left: 50%;\n    top: 0; bottom: 0;\n    border-left: 1px solid #cfc8ba;\n  }\n</style>\n</head>\n<body>\n<div class=\"page\">\n\n  <!-- 页眉 -->\n  <div class=\"header\">\n    <span class=\"swoosh\"></span>\n    <span class=\"logo\">同步解析与测评</span>\n    <span class=\"hdr-right\">数学 &nbsp;五年级 &nbsp;下册</span>\n  </div>\n\n  <h1 class=\"sec\">3.分数加减混合运算</h1>\n  <h2 class=\"lesson\">第 1 课时 &nbsp;&nbsp; 分数加减混合运算</h2>\n\n  <div class=\"tanjiu\">探究 <span class=\"red\">交流</span></div>\n\n  <div class=\"cols\">\n    <!-- 左栏 -->\n    <div class=\"col col-left\">\n      <p style=\"margin:0 0 4px 0;\">小华收集整理的全班同学在母亲节送给妈妈的礼物情况如下表。</p>\n\n      <table class=\"gift\">\n        <tr>\n          <td class=\"rowhead\">礼物类型</td>\n          <td>贺卡</td>\n          <td>鲜花</td>\n          <td>自己画的画</td>\n          <td>其他</td>\n        </tr>\n        <tr>\n          <td class=\"rowhead\">占全班人<br>数的几分<br>之几</td>\n          <td>$\\dfrac{1}{4}$</td>\n          <td>$\\dfrac{3}{20}$</td>\n          <td>$\\dfrac{3}{20}$</td>\n          <td></td>\n        </tr>\n      </table>\n\n      <p class=\"qnum\" style=\"margin:8px 0 2px 0;\">1.送贺卡和送鲜花的同学比送自己画的画的同学多占全班人数的几分之几?</p>\n\n      <p class=\"method\">方法一:</p>\n      <div class=\"step\">\n        $\\dfrac{1}{4}+\\dfrac{3}{20}-\\dfrac{3}{20}$\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"step\" style=\"position:relative;\">\n        $=\\dfrac{\\color{red}{(5)}}{20}+\\dfrac{3}{20}-\\dfrac{3}{10}$\n        <span style=\"position:absolute; left:150px; top:6px; font-size:11px;\">通分</span>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"step\">\n        $=\\dfrac{\\color{red}{(8)}}{20}-\\dfrac{3}{10}$\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"step\" style=\"position:relative;\">\n        <span class=\"box-red\">$=\\dfrac{(8)}{20}-\\dfrac{(6)}{20}$</span>\n        <span style=\"position:absolute; left:150px; top:8px; font-size:11px;\">再次通分</span>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"step\">\n        $=\\dfrac{\\color{red}{(2)}}{20}$\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"step\">\n        $=\\dfrac{\\color{red}{(1)}}{\\color{red}{(10)}}$\n        <span class=\"hand\" style=\"font-size:15px; margin-left:6px;\">$=\\dfrac{1}{10}$</span>\n      </div>\n\n      <p class=\"method\" style=\"margin-top:14px;\">方法二:</p>\n      <div class=\"step\">\n        $\\dfrac{1}{4}+\\dfrac{3}{20}-\\dfrac{3}{20}$\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"step\" style=\"position:relative;\">\n        $=\\dfrac{\\color{red}{(5)}}{20}+\\dfrac{3}{20}-\\dfrac{\\color{red}{(6)}}{20}$\n        <span style=\"position:absolute; left:160px; top:6px; font-size:11px;\">一次通分</span>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"step\" style=\"position:relative;\">\n        $=\\dfrac{\\color{red}{(2)}}{20}$\n        <span style=\"position:absolute; left:120px; top:6px; font-size:11px; color:#555;\">[illegible]</span>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"step\">\n        $=\\dfrac{\\color{red}{(1)}}{\\color{red}{(10)}}$\n      </div>\n    </div>\n\n    <!-- 右栏 -->\n    <div class=\"col col-right\">\n\n      <!-- 顶部机器人与气泡 -->\n      <div class=\"fig-row\">\n        <div class=\"placeholder\" style=\"width:34px;height:34px;\">[Cartoon robot: top-left of right column]</div>\n        <div class=\"bubble\" style=\"width:150px;\">这两种方法有什么<br>不同?哪一种简便?</div>\n      </div>\n\n      <!-- 红色手写批注 -->\n      <div class=\"hand\" style=\"font-size:17px; line-height:1.6; margin:6px 0 10px 4px; transform:rotate(-3deg);\">\n        <span class=\"strike\">过</span>通分次数下同,<br>\n        <span class=\"strike\">磁</span>次一简便。\n      </div>\n\n      <p class=\"qnum\" style=\"margin:14px 0 2px 0;\">2.送其他礼物的同学占全班人数的几分之几?</p>\n\n      <p class=\"method\">方法一:</p>\n      <div class=\"step\">\n        $1-\\dfrac{1}{4}-\\dfrac{3}{20}-\\dfrac{3}{20}$\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"step hand\" style=\"font-size:15px;\">\n        $=1-\\dfrac{5}{20}-\\dfrac{3}{20}-\\dfrac{6}{20}$\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"step hand\" style=\"font-size:15px;\">\n        $=\\dfrac{20}{20}-\\dfrac{5}{20}-\\dfrac{3}{20}-\\dfrac{6}{20}$\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"step hand\" style=\"font-size:15px;\">\n        $=\\dfrac{6}{20}=\\dfrac{3}{10}$\n      </div>\n\n      <p class=\"method\" style=\"margin-top:10px;\">方法二:</p>\n      <div class=\"step\">\n        $1-\\left(\\dfrac{1}{4}+\\dfrac{3}{20}+\\dfrac{3}{20}\\right)$\n      </div>\n\n      <div class=\"fig-row\" style=\"justify-content:flex-end; margin:2px 0;\">\n        <div class=\"bubble\" style=\"width:120px;\">这两个算式有<br>什么不同呢?</div>\n      </div>\n\n      <div class=\"step hand\" style=\"font-size:15px; position:relative;\">\n        $=1-\\left(\\dfrac{5}{20}+\\dfrac{3}{20}+\\dfrac{6}{20}\\right)$\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"fig-row\" style=\"align-items:flex-start; gap:4px;\">\n        <div style=\"flex:1;\">\n          <div class=\"step hand\" style=\"font-size:15px;\">$=1-\\dfrac{14}{20}$</div>\n          <div class=\"step hand\" style=\"font-size:15px;\">$=\\dfrac{6}{20}=\\dfrac{3}{10}$</div>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"placeholder\" style=\"width:44px;height:64px;\">[Cartoon boy pointing: right side]</div>\n      </div>\n\n      <p class=\"qnum\" style=\"margin:12px 0 4px 0;\">3.通过前面的计算,你能说一说分数加减混合运算的运算顺序吗?</p>\n\n      <div class=\"fig-row\">\n        <div class=\"placeholder\" style=\"width:40px;height:50px;\">[Cartoon boy: left of speech box]</div>\n        <div class=\"bubble\" style=\"width:150px;\">\n          分数加减混合运算的运算<br>\n          顺序和整数加减混合运算<br>\n          的运算顺序 <span class=\"hand\" style=\"font-size:14px;\">相同</span>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n\n      <div class=\"fig-row\" style=\"margin-top:8px;\">\n        <div class=\"bubble\" style=\"width:150px;\">\n          没有括号的,按照 <span class=\"hand\" style=\"font-size:14px;\">从左往右</span><br>\n          的顺序计算,有括号的,<br>\n          <span class=\"hand\"><span class=\"oval-red\">先算括号</span></span> 再算 <span class=\"hand\">括号外</span>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"placeholder\" style=\"width:40px;height:50px;\">[Cartoon boy: right of speech box]</div>\n      </div>\n\n    </div>\n  </div>\n\n  <!-- 页脚 -->\n  <div class=\"footer\">\n    <div class=\"placeholder\" style=\"width:24px;height:20px;border:none;\">[Icon: leaf]</div>\n    <div class=\"pagenum\">70</div>\n  </div>\n\n</div>\n</body>\n</html>"
